{"text":"The expectation is that those governments will provide you with public goods such as education, health care, infrastructure and security. In Africa, those goods by and large are provided by the international community. And that is where the problem emerges because even good governments in Africa are not providing public goods. Somebody said to me, you know, actually we should stop wasting our time voting for African governments. We should start voting between the Gates Foundation and USID because they're the ones who are providing the public goods. I mean, it was kind of a joke, but actually, if you think about it, that's exactly the political system that many Westerners live under. So anyway, those are the three things I think we agree on. We don't want Africa to be on aid forever. We want African governments to be incentivized to do the right thing. And again, I think we all have to agree that aid has contributed to dysfunctionality of the African states.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.84},{"text":"expectation","start":0.84,"end":1.26},{"text":"is","start":1.26,"end":1.88},{"text":"that","start":1.88,"end":2.1},{"text":"those","start":2.1,"end":2.44},{"text":"governments","start":2.44,"end":2.86},{"text":"will","start":2.86,"end":3.18},{"text":"provide","start":3.18,"end":3.58},{"text":"you","start":3.58,"end":3.86},{"text":"with","start":3.86,"end":4.02},{"text":"public","start":4.02,"end":4.32},{"text":"goods","start":4.32,"end":4.7},{"text":"such","start":4.7,"end":5.06},{"text":"as","start":5.06,"end":5.24},{"text":"education","start":5.24,"end":5.9,"punct":","},{"text":"health","start":6.12,"end":6.26},{"text":"care","start":6.26,"end":6.72,"punct":","},{"text":"infrastructure","start":7.62,"end":7.76},{"text":"and","start":7.76,"end":8.36},{"text":"security","start":8.36,"end":8.88,"punct":"."},{"text":"In","start":9.86,"end":9.98},{"text":"Africa","start":9.98,"end":10.38,"punct":","},{"text":"those","start":10.6,"end":10.76},{"text":"